  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sahel/Lake Chad youth conference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Abuja Conversations conference aims to bring together youth from conflict-affected parts of the Lake Chad Basin and the Sahel to share and exchange their own experiences in living with violent conflict and how their own lives are affected by ongoing P/CVE efforts in the two respective regions.</narrative>
  </description>
